---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Predictive Email Marketing — Tami McBride"
  description="Take the guesswork out of email marketing using machine learning and analytics based on consumer behavior."
>
  <main class="container project-detail">
    <header class="project-detail__header">
      <h2>Predictive Email Marketing</h2>
      <p class="muted">
        Take the guesswork out of email marketing using machine learning and analytics based on consumer behavior.
      </p>
      <img
        class="project-detail__hero"
        src="/assets/images/all-promos-thumb.png"
        alt="Predictive Email Marketing — promo collage thumbnail"
        loading="lazy"
      />
    </header>

    <section class="project-detail__section">
      <h2>Challenge</h2>
      <p>Rethink the product strategy and user experience.</p>

      <h2>Solution</h2>
      <p>Using a task-based approach, I was able to create a more streamlined experience.</p>

      <p><strong>My Role</strong><br />Lead Product Designer</p>
      <p><strong>Team + Stakeholders</strong><br />CEO, CTO, Project Manager, 3 Developers, UI Designer</p>
    </section>

    <section class="project-detail__section">
      <h2>Discovery</h2>
      <p>
        Working with the client, I was able to quickly understand the business vision and goals. The UI needed a lot of love to bring their vision of
        simplicity and power to the user, however.
      </p>

      <div class="carousel" data-carousel aria-label="Predictive Email Marketing discovery slides">
        <button class="carousel__control" type="button" data-carousel-prev aria-label="Previous slide" title="Previous">←</button>

        <div class="carousel__track" data-carousel-track>
          <button class="carousel__slide" type="button" data-carousel-slide data-full-src="/assets/images/_sitemap.png" aria-label="Open slide 1">
            <img src="/assets/images/_sitemap.png" alt="Discovery sitemap" loading="lazy" />
          </button>
          <button
            class="carousel__slide"
            type="button"
            data-carousel-slide
            data-full-src="/assets/images/_delivery_-_history__1_.png"
            aria-label="Open slide 2"
          >
            <img src="/assets/images/_delivery_-_history__1_.png" alt="Discovery — delivery history" loading="lazy" />
          </button>
          <button class="carousel__slide" type="button" data-carousel-slide data-full-src="/assets/images/_campaigns.png" aria-label="Open slide 3">
            <img src="/assets/images/_campaigns.png" alt="Discovery — campaigns" loading="lazy" />
          </button>
          <button
            class="carousel__slide"
            type="button"
            data-carousel-slide
            data-full-src="/assets/images/_dashboard__1_.png"
            aria-label="Open slide 4"
          >
            <img src="/assets/images/_dashboard__1_.png" alt="Discovery — dashboard" loading="lazy" />
          </button>
        </div>

        <button class="carousel__control" type="button" data-carousel-next aria-label="Next slide" title="Next">→</button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="project-detail__section">
      <h2>Design</h2>

      <div class="carousel" data-carousel aria-label="Predictive Email Marketing design slides">
        <button class="carousel__control" type="button" data-carousel-prev aria-label="Previous slide" title="Previous">←</button>

        <div class="carousel__track" data-carousel-track>
          <button class="carousel__slide" type="button" data-carousel-slide data-full-src="/assets/images/all-promos.png" aria-label="Open slide 1">
            <img src="/assets/images/all-promos.png" alt="Design — promo collage" loading="lazy" />
          </button>
          <button class="carousel__slide" type="button" data-carousel-slide data-full-src="/assets/images/u562.png" aria-label="Open slide 2">
            <img src="/assets/images/u562.png" alt="Design screen 1" loading="lazy" />
          </button>
          <button class="carousel__slide" type="button" data-carousel-slide data-full-src="/assets/images/u563.png" aria-label="Open slide 3">
            <img src="/assets/images/u563.png" alt="Design screen 2" loading="lazy" />
          </button>
        </div>

        <button class="carousel__control" type="button" data-carousel-next aria-label="Next slide" title="Next">→</button>
      </div>

      <p style="margin-top: 14px;">
        <a href="/Work">← Back to Work</a>
      </p>
    </section>

    <div class="image-modal" hidden data-image-modal>
      <button class="image-modal__backdrop" type="button" data-image-modal-close aria-label="Close image"></button>
      <div class="image-modal__content" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="Image preview">
        <button class="image-modal__close" type="button" data-image-modal-close aria-label="Close image" title="Close">×</button>

        <button class="image-modal__nav image-modal__nav--prev" type="button" data-image-modal-prev aria-label="Previous image" title="Previous">
          ←
        </button>
        <button class="image-modal__nav image-modal__nav--next" type="button" data-image-modal-next aria-label="Next image" title="Next">→</button>

        <img class="image-modal__img" data-image-modal-img alt="" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>
